{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Pumpkin Seeds are a type of seed. Mature plants yield ",["l","南瓜","Pumpkin"],"s."]],["p",["They can be purchased at ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"],", at ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],", from the Magic Shop Boat at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," on Winter 17, and occasionally from the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"],". Nine seeds can be obtained from ",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]," at the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"]," after donating 35 items. They can also be obtained by using the ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"],", as well as having a chance of being planted when using ",["l","混合种子","Mixed Seeds"],". Five to twenty Pumpkin Seeds may occasionally be found in ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern. Eight to twenty Pumpkin Seeds may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"]," or ",["l","金色谜之盒","Golden Mystery Box"],"."]]]],["Stages",2,[["p",["Pumpkin can become a ",["l","农作物#Giant Crops","Giant Crop"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 5"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_4.png",48]],[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_5.png",48]],[["f","Pumpkin_Stage_6.png",48]]],[["1 Day"],["2 Days"],["3 Days"],["4 Days"],["3 Days"],["Total: 13 Days"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆",